;; CME Globex holiday schedules day by day and product group, as CME Group
;; published them (yearly holiday calendars on cmegroup.com; each row cites
;; its Wayback copy). Extracted from the schedules' own text; the CME family
;; model must reproduce every row (tests/cme-calendar-test.lisp). :STATUS
;; :closed (no trade date ends that day) | :halt (trades, halts at :TIME, no
;; settlement: trades are for :TRADE-DATE) | :early-close | :regular | :open
;; (trades from :OPEN that day, no overnight session). :TIME is Central Time.
